OL,5,G0440 Four in a Bed
OL,6,     FGolfer Raj hosts at the Leafy
OL,7,     FSuburban B&B in Hertfordshire,
OL,8,     Fwhere the house rules include
OL,9,     Fremoving your shoes at the door.
OL,10,     FNeil and Jo aren't impressed by a
OL,11,     Fsurprise visitor in their bed.
OL,12,G0505 Four in a Bed
OL,13,     FThe final visit is to The
OL,14,     FWellington Inn in Hertfordshire,
OL,15,     Fwhere resources manager Felicity
OL,16,     FRainbow's spiritual approach to
OL,17,     Fhosting includes cleansing the
OL,18,     Frooms' auras.
