OL,5,G0530 Four in a Bed
OL,6,     FIt's the final day of the
OL,7,     Fcompetition and the B&Bers meet
OL,8,     Ffor the last time to find out how
OL,9,     Fmuch they've been paid and to
OL,10,     Fsettle some scores. After bitter
OL,11,     Frebukes, the winner is announced.
OL,12,G0555 Find It, Fix It, Flog It
OL,13,     FIn Oxfordshire, Simon O'Brien and
OL,14,     FHenry Cole clear out Clare's
OL,15,     Fsheds, which are stuffed full of
OL,16,     Fagricultural memorabilia.
